# Samplex quiz video: property relations (FC 74-148). Questions come verbatim from the quiz bank
# (data/quiz_bank/06-10, origin "samplex"); this file adds what the video needs per item:
#   t    chapter title
#   x    the brief spoken explanation after the reveal
#   s    TF/pair: per statement, the visual fix. Ops on the statement text:
#          ("x", wrong, right)  strike `wrong`, write `right`
#          ("+", anchor, text)  insert `text` after `anchor` ("^" = start, "$" = end)
#          ("ok", phrase)       mark a phrase green (it is what makes the statement true)
#          ("hl", phrase)       mark a phrase amber (the problem the note explains)
#        plus "n" (note) and "c" (citation)
#   w    MCQ: one short verdict per choice
#   tip  optional Uribe line
